# Required. The intake reviewer, the art director and both print reviewers all
# run on Claude.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional. A file of additional blocked terms, one per line, # for comments.
# Its contents are ADDED to the built-in list in lib/policy/blocked-terms.ts —
# it can never empty the list by being missing or malformed. This is where a
# maintained multilingual slur list belongs, so trust & safety can update it
# without a code deploy.
# BLOCKED_TERMS_PATH=/etc/studio/blocked-terms.txt
